# | Advantech ADAM-4015 — 6-Channel RTD Temperature Input Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 1)
# | - 6-channel RTD temperature input, Modbus RTU.
# | - FC02 00201-00206 (addr 200-205): Burn-out Signal ch0-5 (0=Normal, 1=Burn-out).
# | - FC03 40001-40006 (addr 0-5): Current Value ch0-5 (s16, ×0.1°C).
# | - FC03 40201-40206 (addr 200-205): Type Code ch0-5, R/W.
# | - FC03 40211 (addr 210): Module Name; 40221 (addr 220): Channel Enable bitmask.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
